{"unit_id":"Flan246__dsh-latex-guard#card-zh","repo":"Flan246/dsh-latex-guard","commit":"45b326bf9f5dfab8884c0fa9580cb90298bc85d5","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-latex-guard 是面向 DSH agent 的 LaTeX 与 BibTeX 工具插件，通过注册四个工具检查 LaTeX 编译、整理 BibTeX 条目、从 Crossref 补全文献字段，并核对正文引用与文献表。编译检查可自动选择或指定 pdflatex、xelatex、lualatex，并返回错误、警告和缺失引用；BibTeX 工具可检查重复键与必需字段、补全 DOI 或标题对应的资料、比较引用键。适合在写论文或维护 LaTeX 项目时检查文献数据和编译结果。bib-fill 会向 Crossref 查询 DOI 或标题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/plugin.ts:48-151","src/core/check.ts:55-145","src/core/bib-fill.ts:25-59","src/core/bib-lint.ts:20-40","src/core/cite-audit.ts:7-23"]}
